@la-lisa, @florine2623 I can confirm occurrences of that issue too. In our shop's DB I discovered 94 cases of duplications and even a case of triple repetition. In a span of 3 years. 
And this issue is old one, not specific to 1.7.8.x. 
In our case is 1.7.7.6, before middle 2021 it was 1.7.2.4.

@florine2623 please don't ignore or close this issue like in case of [#23025](https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/issues/23025)
From ONE human physic perspective is not possible manually reproduce this, because orders should be performed in the same second. For this should be used some automation tests or request some assistance of a PS developer.

In my opinion this is CRITICAL issue, that in some cases may imply legal consequences for shop owners.
